Olymparch hardware plan

  Machine    desktop · Example Builder Tower B450
  CPU        AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (AuthenticAMD)
  Graphics   0000:07:00.0 10de:1b81 (nouveau, primary)

Matched rules
