                               packages: vulkan-nouveau lib32-vulkan-nouveau
  ucode-amd                  AMD CPU microcode
                               packages: amd-ucode
  bluetooth                  Bluetooth
                               packages: bluez bluez-utils
                               services: bluetooth.service
  xbox-dongle                Xbox wireless adapter: xone driver
                               ourrepo: xone

Firmware
  linux-firmware-nvidia      for nouveau
  linux-firmware-realtek     for rtl_bt/rtl8761bu_fw.bin (kernel log)

To install (7)
  vulkan-nouveau lib32-vulkan-nouveau amd-ucode bluez bluez-utils linux-firmware-nvidia
  linux-firmware-realtek
