Notes
  gpu-nvidia-legacy: not promised: installed, but not tested
  gpu-nvidia-legacy: GTX 900/1000 cards run at low clocks on the open driver, so games are slow. The desktop works.
  xbox-dongle: beta: should work, not yet tested on real machines
